          "写成单数和复数前缀的配对：",
          "",
          "   n/n    salama -> salama  （不变）",
          "   m/wa   mtoto  -> watoto  （人）",
          "   ji/ma  jambo  -> mambo",
          "",
          "听这些配对：                          按 1",
          "",
          "动词等词不带标记，语音也从不读它，",
          "但它和单词一样要记住：类别驱动",
          "着它周围的语法。",
          "",
          "第3课和第7课会打开这台引擎，",
          "其余类别会随各自的第一张卡片到来。"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Salama. Salama. Mtoto. Watoto. Jambo. Mambo."
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 4,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Salama. Sawa. Hapana.",
          "2": "Heri. Kwaheri. Mzee.",
          "3": "Rafiki. Jina. Bibi.",
          "4": "Hodi. Pole. Ndiyo.",
          "5": "Bwana. Salamu. Starehe."
        },
        "content": [
          "Karibu！斯瓦希里语怎么读就怎么拼。",
          "五个元音，始终清晰，从不静音：",
          "",
          "",
          "a = “啊”，如 father                   按 1",
          "   salama, sawa, hapana",
          "",
          "e = “诶”，如 bet                      按 2",
          "   heri, kwaheri, mzee",
          "",
          "i = “衣”，如 machine                  按 3",
          "   rafiki, jina, bibi",
          "",
          "o = “哦”，如 note                     按 4",
          "   hodi, pole, ndiyo",
          "",
          "u = “乌”，如 flute                    按 5",
          "   bwana, salamu, starehe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 3,
        "total_pages": 4,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Tafadhali.",
          "2": "Shikamoo. Kushukuru.",
          "3": "Nyanya.",
          "4": "Ng'ombe."
        },
        "content": [
          "几个值得早点认识的辅音：",
          "",
          "dh = “th”，如 this                    按 1",
          "   tafadhali",
          "",
          "sh = 如英语 ship                      按 2",
          "   shikamoo, kushukuru",
          "",
          "ny = “ni”，如 onion                   按 3",
          "   nyanya（奶奶——很快会学到！）",
          "",
          "ng' = “ng”，如 singer，无硬 g 音      按 4",
          "   ng'ombe（奶牛——稍后出现！）",
          "",
          "j 发软音，如 jam：jambo, jina。",
          "r 轻微卷舌：rafiki, heri。"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 4,
        "total_pages": 4,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Salama. Rafiki. Tafadhali."
        },
        "content": [
          "重音规则——只有一条：",
          "永远落在倒数第二个音节。",
          "",
          "sa-LA-ma    ra-FI-ki    ta-fa-DHA-li",
          "",
          "听这节奏：                            按 1",
          "   salama, rafiki, tafadhali",
          "",
          "每个音节都以元音结尾，",
